 "verdict_reason": "Only 7 positives (0.72% of pairs), no same-line cross-study positives to validate them, replicate GI agreement is poor (Spearman 0.09-0.18; per-line split-rule AUROC unstable 0.41-0.94 on 1-6 positives, pooled 0.69/0.70 barely above the gate), and single-gene fitness alone predicts the labels at AUROC 0.92 (all positives involve essential genes CDK1/CDK7/CDK9/CDK12/PRMT5/CDK11B/CDK4). The well-known CDK8-CDK19 paralog SL is not recovered (contradicting harle2025 in other lines). Scores are usable as measurements; labels are not benchmark-grade."
